 $ lies in the first quadrant, then $\\theta ={\\theta }_{R}={63}^{∘}.$\n\n- If $\\theta $ lies in the second quadrant, then $\\theta ={180}^{∘}-{\\theta }_{R}={180}^{∘}-{63}^{∘}={117}^{∘}.$\n\n- If $\\theta $ lies in the third quadrant, then $\\theta ={180}^{∘}+{\\theta }_{R}={180}^{∘}+{63}^{∘}={243}^{∘}.$\n\n- If $\\theta $ lies in the fourth quadrant, then $\\theta ={360}^{∘}-{\\theta }_{R}={360}^{∘}-{63}^{∘}={297}^{∘}.$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, $\\theta $ can be equal to ${63}^{∘},$ ${117}^{∘},$ ${243}^{∘},$ and ${297}^{∘}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186542164 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110689 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e10328e3-ff59-50d9-a3c3-ef145fe1bc16" :knowledge-point/title "Finding All of the Angles With a Given Reference Angle"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ff243ce-9e5c-53f8-81a5-b666cef06e5b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "195" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541586}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4ff243ce-9e5c-53f8-81a5-b666cef06e5b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "195" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541586} :answer-field/id #uuid "3e18626d-1227-55b6-86bf-1a78bb55f260" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541998} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7ad73251-7899-5d5d-ab1a-253e3bc08128" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "165" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541674}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7ad73251-7899-5d5d-ab1a-253e3bc08128" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "165" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186541674} :answer-field/id #uuid "fbebeccd-e77b-5f62-9c3c-6a6c0baaaa45" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :